  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voices of Youths in Cameroon for Peace  (VOYCE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Prevent youth radicalization and re-radicalization (return to violence) in the conflict communities in the North West (NW) and South West (SW) Regions of Cameroon trough improving their participation in the promotion of peace and in the implementation of inclusive and effective locally-led conflict prevention efforts&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
